        ],
        "text": "The authors propose an algebraic characterization of free operations through preservation of integer-valued stabilizer Pauli spectra, and describe three possible Pauli transfer matrix forms for deterministic pure-state stabilizer protocols. This is an unverified author-claim candidate whose full equivalence is not sufficiently specified for a standalone MathClaim here."
      }
